Northern Soul is a 2014 British historical film directed by Elaine Constantine.

10
01:12:51,428 --> 01:12:57,428
It tells the story of two young Lancashire teenagers, Matt and John, whose lives are changed forever by the
discovery of African-American soul music and the dance culture that grew up around it in Britain.

11
